  "stable_boundaries": [
    "Dispatch is not a Google Calendar event. Calendar events are projections.",
    "LINE is a notification channel, not a source of truth.",
    "Project cost sources remain traceable to source records.",
    "Drawing is distinct from DrawingVersion.",
    "User authorization is evaluated before AI retrieval.",
    "Planned Dispatch time is not Actual Attendance and is not Approved Labor Time.",
    "Offline client state is a bounded cache/queue; server records remain authoritative unless a future ADR explicitly changes ownership.",
    "Accounting provider data is integrated through adapters and reconciliation; provider-specific identifiers do not leak into core project/cost semantics."
